{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17681","headline":"辞魏博田尚书出境後感恩恋德因登藂台 · 杨巨源","name":"辞魏博田尚书出境後感恩恋德因登藂台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荐书及龙锺，此事镂心骨。\n亲知殊悢悢，徒御方咄咄。\n藂台邯郸郭，台上见新月。\n离恨始分明，[归思]□□更超忽。\n怀仁泪空尽，感事情又发。\n他时躧履声，晓日照丹阙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}